{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-cost-proxies","title":"零成本代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/efficiency/zero-cost-proxies","wordCount":1440,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"零成本代理\">零成本代理</h1><p><a href=\"performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a>还需要一批标注来训练，<a href=\"weight-sharing\">超网</a>还需要训练超网本身。零成本代理（zero-cost proxies）把省钱推到逻辑终点：完全不训练任何东西，只在一个随机初始化的网络上跑一次前向加反向，用梯度、激活、雅可比这些信号给架构打一个分。一个架构的评估从几小时压到几秒甚至几毫秒。这是 NAS 效率光谱上最激进的一端，也是争议最大的一端——它有时和真实精度强相关，有时几乎失效。这一篇客观地讲清楚它怎么work、为什么work、以及它的能力边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-训练无关的架构打分\">核心概念：训练无关的架构打分</h2><p>零成本代理基于一个大胆假设：一个架构的「好坏」在它被训练之前，就已经部分写在它的初始化网络的某些数值性质里了。这些性质可以用一次（甚至零次）前向反向算出来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[随机初始化的网络&lt;br/&gt;未经任何训练] --&gt; B[喂一个小批数据]&#10;    B --&gt; C[一次前向+反向]&#10;    C --&gt; D[提取信号]&#10;    D --&gt; E[梯度相关&lt;br/&gt;SNIP/GraSP/Synflow]&#10;    D --&gt; F[激活相关&lt;br/&gt;NWOT/激活区分度]&#10;    D --&gt; G[雅可比相关&lt;br/&gt;Jacobian协方差]&#10;    E --&gt; H[聚合成单一分数]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[分数当代理排名&lt;br/&gt;搜索时秒级评估]\">flowchart TD\n    A[随机初始化的网络&lt;br/&gt;未经任何训练] --&gt; B[喂一个小批数据]\n    B --&gt; C[一次前向+反向]\n    C --&gt; D[提取信号]\n    D --&gt; E[梯度相关&lt;br/&gt;SNIP/GraSP/Synflow]\n    D --&gt; F[激活相关&lt;br/&gt;NWOT/激活区分度]\n    D --&gt; G[雅可比相关&lt;br/&gt;Jacobian协方差]\n    E --&gt; H[聚合成单一分数]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[分数当代理排名&lt;br/&gt;搜索时秒级评估]</pre><p>和<a href=\"performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a>的关键区别：零成本代理<strong>不需要任何训练数据来拟合</strong>——它是一个固定的解析公式，直接作用在初始化网络上。这让它的边际成本几乎为零，但也意味着它无法像预测器那样从数据里学习修正自己的偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主流零成本代理一览\">主流零成本代理一览</h2><p>零成本代理大多借自网络剪枝文献——剪枝里用来判断「哪些权重重要」的显著性指标，被搬来判断「哪个架构重要」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代理</th>\n<th>信号来源</th>\n<th>核心直觉</th>\n<th>是否需数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SNIP</td>\n<td>损失对权重的梯度幅度</td>\n<td>连接显著性大的网络更可训练</td>\n<td>需一个小批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraSP</td>\n<td>梯度与 Hessian 的乘积</td>\n<td>保留梯度流的连接更重要</td>\n<td>需一个小批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SynFlow</td>\n<td>各层乘积型显著性（无数据）</td>\n<td>保全梯度流、抗层坍缩</td>\n<td>不需数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fisher</td>\n<td>激活的 Fisher 信息</td>\n<td>信息量大的通道更有用</td>\n<td>需一个小批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NWOT</td>\n<td>不同样本激活模式的可区分度</td>\n<td>能区分输入的网络表达力强</td>\n<td>需一个小批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zen-score</td>\n<td>表达力的高斯复杂度度量</td>\n<td>量化网络的表达能力</td>\n<td>不需标签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 SynFlow 为例，它对一个架构计算的分数是各层显著性的乘积型聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mtext>SynFlow</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⊙</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>l</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{S}_{\\text{SynFlow}} = \\sum_i \\left| \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{R}}{\\partial \\theta_i} \\odot \\theta_i \\right|, \\quad \\mathcal{R} = \\mathbf{1}^\\top \\left( \\prod_l |\\theta_l| \\right) \\mathbf{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.075em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SynFlow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7276em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的妙处在于完全不用数据和标签——用全 1 输入流过权重绝对值，专门为抵抗「逐层剪枝会把某层全砍光」的坍缩而设计。NWOT 则相反，它喂一个小批真实数据，看不同样本在网络里激活出的二值模式有多不同——能把不同输入区分开的网络，被认为表达力更强、更可能训得好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么有时有效-有时失效\">为什么有时有效，有时失效</h2><p>零成本代理最诚实的描述是：它们的有效性强烈依赖搜索空间。多项 2024-2025 年的基准研究系统比较了十几个代理在多个任务上的<a href=\"../foundations/search-eval-basics\">排序相关性</a>，结论相当一致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 NAS-Bench-201 这类小而规整的搜索空间上，最好的代理能到 Kendall&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau \\approx 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 左右，确实有用。</li>\n<li>换到 ImageNet-1K 这类大规模任务，或换一个搜索空间，同一个代理的相关性可能骤降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 以下，几乎和瞎猜无异（来源：An Evaluation of Zero-Cost Proxies, IJCV 2024）。</li>\n<li>一个令人警醒的发现：在某些基准上，「参数量」或「FLOPs」这种平凡基线的排序相关性，竟然不输甚至超过精心设计的零成本代理——说明这些代理可能只是在间接度量网络规模。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这解释了为什么没有任何单一代理能通吃。2025 年的研究方向因此转向<strong>组合代理</strong>：用进化算法或 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">LLM 引导</a> 去自动搜索多个代理的组合公式，让它们互补（如 ICML 2025 的 RZ-NAS 用反思式零成本策略，GECCO 2025 用进化搜索综合代理）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在-nas-流水线里怎么用\">在 NAS 流水线里怎么用</h2><p>零成本代理几乎从不单独使用——它太不稳，单用风险太大。它最有价值的用法是<strong>粗筛</strong>：在搜索流水线前端用零成本代理快速淘汰掉大量明显差的候选，把搜索空间缩小一两个数量级，再对剩下的小集合用更可靠（也更贵）的方法精挑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[海量候选架构] --&gt;|零成本代理秒级打分| B[淘汰底部大多数]&#10;    B --&gt; C[剩余少量有潜力候选]&#10;    C --&gt;|超网/性能预测器| D[更可靠的中等成本评估]&#10;    D --&gt; E[少数最优候选]&#10;    E --&gt;|诚实完整训练| F[最终架构]\">flowchart TD\n    A[海量候选架构] --&gt;|零成本代理秒级打分| B[淘汰底部大多数]\n    B --&gt; C[剩余少量有潜力候选]\n    C --&gt;|超网/性能预测器| D[更可靠的中等成本评估]\n    D --&gt; E[少数最优候选]\n    E --&gt;|诚实完整训练| F[最终架构]</pre><p>这是一个典型的「成本递增的级联筛选」：每一级用越来越贵、越来越准的方法，处理越来越少的候选。它把零成本代理的「快」和<a href=\"weight-sharing\">超网</a>、<a href=\"performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a>的「准」组合起来，扬长避短。判断该不该把某个代理放进流水线，唯一标准还是它在<strong>你的</strong>搜索空间上的排序相关性——这是贯穿 <a href=\"./\">整章效率</a> 与 <a href=\"../automl-applications/nas-in-practice\">落地与基准</a> 的铁律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>零成本代理完全不训练，只用初始化网络上一次前向反向的梯度/激活/雅可比信号给架构打分，是效率光谱最激进的一端。</li>\n<li>与 <a href=\"performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a> 不同，它是固定解析公式、无需训练数据，但也无法从数据里学习修正偏差。</li>\n<li>主流代理（SNIP、GraSP、SynFlow、NWOT、Zen-score）多借自剪枝文献，SynFlow 甚至完全不用数据。</li>\n<li>有效性强烈依赖搜索空间：小规整空间上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau \\approx 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>，大空间可能骤降到 0.2；有时还不如 FLOPs 基线——故 2025 年转向组合代理。</li>\n<li>最佳用法是级联粗筛：零成本代理淘汰大多数，再用 <a href=\"weight-sharing\">超网/预测器</a> 精挑、诚实训练定案；唯一选用标准是你空间上的 <a href=\"../foundations/search-eval-basics\">排序相关性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"零成本代理","id":"零成本代理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：训练无关的架构打分","id":"核心概念-训练无关的架构打分"},{"level":2,"text":"主流零成本代理一览","id":"主流零成本代理一览"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么有时有效，有时失效","id":"为什么有时有效-有时失效"},{"level":2,"text":"在 NAS 流水线里怎么用","id":"在-nas-流水线里怎么用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能预测器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/efficiency/performance-prediction"},"next":{"title":"超参优化与 AutoML","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/automl-applications/hpo-automl"}}